  "instruction_steps": [
    {
      "step_number": 1,
      "instruction": "For Chocolate Cake:Ready all the ingredients. Powder the oreo biscuits, pinch salt and mix warm milk as needed and make a cake batter. Add in baking powder and vinegar and mix.",
      "ingredients_used": [
        "2ee94e8b-d6eb-51d7-9578-e6d89c3952e7",
        "33ae9802-d788-513d-a493-c5c6c5d124a3",
        "43eba239-749f-557c-b980-34ef5f25c6ee",
        "c5186ec9-6ff6-560e-8350-0841e3f16da8",
        "999108a3-6339-5870-be79-7e6c04a59066",
        "412d1231-552d-5ebd-87dd-1a865e075f52",
        "574ed167-9615-516d-873e-59ecaaeb9da1",
        "752fc244-ec5d-5090-9117-aefbe3a5b4d3",
        "e34fa6af-97f0-5d19-b4ed-743d8b8f8f78"
      ]
    },
    {
      "step_number": 2,
      "instruction": "Grease a loose bottomed tin. Pour a 1cm thick layer of the batter."
    },
    {
      "step_number": 3,
      "instruction": "Bake in a preheated oven @160°C for 7-8 minutes or until the knife comes out clean. Cool on wire rack.",
      "timer_seconds": 480,
      "temperature": {
        "value": 160,
        "unit": "celsius"
      }
    },
    {
      "step_number": 4,
      "instruction": "For Homemade Pistachio Paste:Ready all the pistachio paste ingredients. Slightly melt white chocolate on a double boiler.(else the mixer blade may break) Coarsely powder the pistachio in mixer. Add in condensed milk.",
      "ingredients_used": [
        "2ee94e8b-d6eb-51d7-9578-e6d89c3952e7",
        "31e136cf-a25e-55d3-b97d-557f1c0d9361",
        "33ae9802-d788-513d-a493-c5c6c5d124a3",
        "43eba239-749f-557c-b980-34ef5f25c6ee",
        "999108a3-6339-5870-be79-7e6c04a59066",
        "e34fa6af-97f0-5d19-b4ed-743d8b8f8f78"
      ]
    },
    {
      "step_number": 5,
      "instruction": "Add in slightly warmed and slightly melted white chocolate and milk as required and crush to a smooth paste.(Green food color can be add. I haven't.)",
      "ingredients_used": [
        "2ee94e8b-d6eb-51d7-9578-e6d89c3952e7",
        "33ae9802-d788-513d-a493-c5c6c5d124a3",
        "43eba239-749f-557c-b980-34ef5f25c6ee",
        "999108a3-6339-5870-be79-7e6c04a59066",
        "e34fa6af-97f0-5d19-b4ed-743d8b8f8f78"
      ]
    },
    {
      "step_number": 6,
      "instruction": "For Kunafa: In a kadhaai take ghee and roast the sevaiiya on slow gas. Keep stirring until a pleasant roasted aroma releases. Cool it. Add in the Homemade pistachio paste.Mix well.",
      "ingredients_used": [
        "31e136cf-a25e-55d3-b97d-557f1c0d9361",
        "6327a78d-7f39-52aa-a531-aa9f4ba1679f",
        "00406681-2de9-58cd-933c-cad8847c104e"
      ]
    },
    {
      "step_number": 7,
      "instruction": "Lip smacking Kunafa is ready. Spread a 2 cm layer on the cooled chocolate cake.",
      "ingredients_used": [
        "2ee94e8b-d6eb-51d7-9578-e6d89c3952e7",
        "e34fa6af-97f0-5d19-b4ed-743d8b8f8f78"
      ]
    },
    {
      "step_number": 8,
      "instruction": "Melt dark chocolate and strained malai and prepare the chocolate ganache. Cool and pour on the Kunafa layer.",
      "ingredients_used": [
        "2ee94e8b-d6eb-51d7-9578-e6d89c3952e7",
        "e34fa6af-97f0-5d19-b4ed-743d8b8f8f78",
        "e1554f6f-515b-51f1-9790-02e773fdc2c2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "step_number": 9,
      "instruction": "Garnish Pistachio Kunafa Chocolate Cake with chopped pistachio and silver balls. Keep in fridge for 2-3 hours. Then unmould the Kunafa Cake.",
      "timer_seconds": 10800,
      "ingredients_used": [
        "2ee94e8b-d6eb-51d7-9578-e6d89c3952e7",
        "31e136cf-a25e-55d3-b97d-557f1c0d9361",
        "e34fa6af-97f0-5d19-b4ed-743d8b8f8f78"
      ]
    },
    {
      "step_number": 10,
      "instruction": "I also prepared Kunafa cupcakes. Cut and enjoy. The cake looked so pretty that we could either save it or have it!! ☺"
    },
    {
      "step_number": 11,
      "instruction": "Cross sectional view of the Pistachio Kunafa Chocolate Cake.",
      "ingredients_used": [
        "2ee94e8b-d6eb-51d7-9578-e6d89c3952e7",
        "31e136cf-a25e-55d3-b97d-557f1c0d9361",
        "e34fa6af-97f0-5d19-b4ed-743d8b8f8f78"
      ]
    },
    {
      "step_number": 12,
      "instruction": "Enjoy with a new sweet delicacy this festive season with family and friends."
    }
  ],
